{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8d7fdbbc5c2c1b68","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8006-E002\n3\ttitle: Determine AuthBridge sidecar variant set for Tech Preview\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8006\n5\tcomponent: Agentic\n6\tteam: Kagenti\n7\ttype: Investigation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tinvestigation_signals:\n11\t  question_specificity: 1\n12\t  source_accessibility: 0\n13\t  local_runnability: 0\n14\t  cluster_hardware_dependence: 0\n15\t  human_judgment_required: -2\n16\timplementation_type: null\n17\tai_signals: null\n18\tai_implementability: Low\n19\tai_implementability_score: -1\n20\tjira_key: null\n21\tbranch: null\n22\tgated_by: null\n23\tgate_failure_impact: null\n24\t---\n25\t# Determine AuthBridge sidecar variant set for Tech Preview\n26\t\n27\t## Description\n28\t\n29\tDecide which AuthBridge sidecar image variants ship in Tech Preview. Upstream kagenti-extensions provides three variants — `authbridge-proxy` (full proxy, default mode), `authbridge-envoy` (Envoy ext_proc mode), and `authbridge-lite` (auth-only) — and each requires its own Konflux component and FIPS-compliant build. The default assumption for TP is the minimum viable set: `authbridge-proxy` only.\n30\t\n31\t## Scope\n32\t\n33\t- Confirm the default-mode variant (`authbridge-proxy`) is required for TP\n34\t- Decide whether `authbridge-envoy` and `authbridge-lite` are needed for the target release or can ship in a later release, with PM input\n35\t- Record the final variant list and the Konflux components it implies (one component per variant)\n36\t\n37\t## Acceptance Criteria\n38\t\n39\t- A decision document records the TP variant set with rationale and PM sign-off\n40\t- Each variant in the decided set has a corresponding planned Konflux component; variants deferred to a later release are explicitly listed as deferred\n41\t\n42\t## HLR Traceability\n43\t\n44\t- Gates the P1 HLR \"AuthBridge proxy sidecar image built via Konflux with FIPS compliance\" by fixing how many image variants that build onboarding covers\n45\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b8831966e1a3b1fc","agent_id":"a79e5f145260581af","session_id":"5aaaeded-1f18-481f-917f-f792958e6a2c","uuid":"b0a56210-cfea-47d2-bf15-8119bd9c4bd4","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:51:54.470Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8d7fdbbc5c2c1b68","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
