{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9f15295dd27b0735","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8006-E003\n3\ttitle: Decide dashboard Tech Preview integration depth\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8006\n5\tcomponent: AI Core Dashboard\n6\tteam: Dashboard\n7\ttype: Investigation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tinvestigation_signals:\n11\t  question_specificity: 1\n12\t  source_accessibility: 0\n13\t  local_runnability: 0\n14\t  cluster_hardware_dependence: 0\n15\t  human_judgment_required: -2\n16\timplementation_type: null\n17\tai_signals: null\n18\tai_implementability: Low\n19\tai_implementability_score: -1\n20\tjira_key: null\n21\tbranch: null\n22\tgated_by: null\n23\tgate_failure_impact: null\n24\t---\n25\t# Decide dashboard Tech Preview integration depth\n26\t\n27\t## Description\n28\t\n29\tDecide the Tech Preview shape of the agent views in the OpenShift AI dashboard: a minimal agent-list tab in an existing project view (roughly 1 sprint of dashboard effort) versus a standalone navigation section (roughly 2 sprints). The answer changes the UI surface, the BFF scope, and the UX design work required.\n30\t\n31\t## Scope\n32\t\n33\t- Obtain PM/UX direction on TP dashboard depth (tab in an existing project view vs standalone navigation entry)\n34\t- Capture the UX design direction for the read-only agent list (list AgentRuntime CRs, show status, link to workload details — full agent management UI is out of scope for this strategy)\n35\t- Record the decision so the dashboard BFF plugin and UI scope are fixed\n36\t\n37\t## Acceptance Criteria\n38\t\n39\t- A decision is recorded with PM/UX sign-off stating which integration depth ships in TP\n40\t- The read-only TP scope (agent list with status and workload links) is confirmed as the content of the agent views\n41\t\n42\t## HLR Traceability\n43\t\n44\t- Gates the P1 HLR \"Dashboard integration infrastructure: BFF plugin registration and feature flag for agent views\" by fixing the UI surface the BFF plugin serves\n45\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b8831966e1a3b1fc","agent_id":"a79e5f145260581af","session_id":"5aaaeded-1f18-481f-917f-f792958e6a2c","uuid":"fadd2f72-5178-41b5-8483-1d67315cc21e","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:51:58.655Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9f15295dd27b0735","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
