 `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entries for the kagenti-operator image and every AuthBridge variant in the Tech Preview scope, with SHA256-pinned digests available at packaging time (the digests are filled in from the Konflux-built images — a configuration reference, not a build dependency)\n48\t- Given a disconnected RHOAI installation using image mirroring with the component `Managed`, the operator and AuthBridge images resolve from the mirrored registry via the `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entries, measured by the kagenti-operator Deployment running with images from the mirror registry\n49\t\n50\t## HLR Traceability\n51\t\n52\t- P1 HLR: OLM/CSV packaging with `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entries for disconnected installation\n53\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bfa115eb70992148","agent_id":"af7944a590e02bfb7","session_id":"5aaaeded-1f18-481f-917f-f792958e6a2c","uuid":"979c26cb-38b3-4398-a4cc-0bd257f2b762","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:59:50.600Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b54a5445656334c9","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
