{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-97f7ecacb548a768","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8006-E009\n3\ttitle: Konflux build onboarding for the kagenti-operator image\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8006\n5\tcomponent: Agentic\n6\tteam: Kagenti\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\timplementation_type: konflux-onboarding\n10\tdependencies:\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-8006-E006\n12\tai_signals:\n13\t  change_specificity: 1\n14\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n15\t  adapter_pattern: 1\n16\t  existing_foundation: 1\n17\t  open_questions: 1\n18\t  external_dependency: 0\n19\t  human_process_gates: -1\n20\t  repo_access: 1\n21\t  architecture_claims: 1\n22\tinvestigation_signals: null\n23\tai_implementability: High\n24\tai_implementability_score: 6\n25\tjira_key: null\n26\tbranch: null\n27\tgated_by: null\n28\tgate_failure_impact: null\n29\t---\n30\t# Konflux build onboarding for the kagenti-operator image\n31\t\n32\t## Description\n33\t\n34\tOnboard the kagenti-operator container image to the Konflux build pipeline with FIPS-compliant Go compilation on a UBI9 base, following the same recipe as the platform's other Go operators (rhods-operator, model-registry-operator). This is the critical-path item for the release: submit the onboarding request immediately due to pipeline lead time.\n35\t\n36\t## Scope\n37\t\n38\t- Convert/author the Dockerfile for the kagenti-operator image following the multi-stage pattern used by the platform's Go operators: builder stage compiles with FIPS flags (`CGO_ENABLED=1`, `GOEXPERIMENT=strictfipsruntime`), production stage copies the binary onto `ubi9/ubi-minimal`\n39\t- Add `rpms.lock.yaml` for RPM lockfile pinning and `go.sum` for Go dependency locking\n40\t- Create and submit the Konflux component and build pipeline for the kagenti-operator image built from the `opendatahub-io/kagenti-operator` midstream fork\n41\t- Multi-arch support: AMD64 required for TP; arm64 if the pipeline supports it without additional effort\n42\t- Apply the upstream-first policy for any significant source changes needed for the build (upstream `kagenti/kagenti-operator` first, then pull into midstream)\n43\t- Container security baseline: non-root execution (USER 65532:65532), capability dropping, `seccompProfile.type: RuntimeDefault`\n44\t\n45\t## Acceptance Criteria\n46\t\n47\t- The kagenti-operator image passes the Konflux build pipeline `check-payload` validation for FIPS compliance (binary linked against OpenSSL, no statically-linked Go crypto)\n48\t- The image is built on a UBI9 base with the multi-stage FIPS Dockerfile pattern\n49\t- RPM and Go dependency lockfiles are present and enforced by the pipeline\n50\t- AMD64 build succeeds; arm64 is built if supported without additional effort (recorded either way)\n51\t- The build runs from the opendatahub-io midstream fork\n52\t\n53\t## HLR Traceability\n54\t\n55\t- P0 HLR: Operator images built via Konflux with FIPS-compliant Go compilation (`GOEXPERIMENT=strictfipsruntime`, `CGO_ENABLED=1`) on UBI9 base\n56\t- P2 HLR: Multi-arch builds (AMD64 required for TP; arm64 if pipeline supports it without additional effort)\n57\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b1933c3e4a75d57c","agent_id":"a39dea4f4915a7ea0","session_id":"5aaaeded-1f18-481f-917f-f792958e6a2c","uuid":"9d3e2358-e291-4be7-94b1-8590b50b1794","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:11:49.516Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-97f7ecacb548a768","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review revised decomposition"}
