tandard Go sidecar pattern\n44\t- Create and submit one Konflux component per variant in the decided set\n45\t- Add `rpms.lock.yaml` for RPM lockfile pinning and `go.sum` for Go dependency locking\n46\t- Multi-arch support: AMD64 required for TP; arm64 if the pipeline supports it without additional effort\n47\t- Apply the upstream-first policy for any significant source changes needed for the build (upstream `kagenti/kagenti-extensions` first, then pull into midstream)\n48\t- The AuthBridge sidecar proxy handles TLS termination and must use FIPS-approved cipher suites\n49\t\n50\t## Acceptance Criteria\n51\t\n52\t- Each AuthBridge image variant in the decided TP set passes the Konflux build pipeline `check-payload` validation for FIPS compliance\n53\t- Images are built on UBI9 bases from the opendatahub-io midstream fork\n54\t- RPM and Go dependency lockfiles are present and enforced by the pipeline\n55\t- AMD64 builds succeed; arm64 is built if supported without additional effort (recorded either way)\n56\t\n57\t## HLR Traceability\n58\t\n59\t- P1 HLR: AuthBridge proxy sidecar image built via Konflux with FIPS compliance\n60\t- P2 HLR: Multi-arch builds (AMD64 required for TP; arm64 if pipeline supports it without additional effort)\n61\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b1933c3e4a75d57c","agent_id":"a39dea4f4915a7ea0","session_id":"5aaaeded-1f18-481f-917f-f792958e6a2c","uuid":"c62326ca-55c1-40e2-a2be-49c36dbb0d4b","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:11:50.489Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9ec37e376c4102b9","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review revised decomposition"}
