{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-aed4f20516bf7474","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8006-E012\n3\ttitle: OLM/CSV packaging with RELATED_IMAGE entries for disconnected installation\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8006\n5\tcomponent: AI Core Platform\n6\tteam: Platform / ODH Operator\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-8006-E002\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-8006-E011\n12\tai_signals:\n13\t  change_specificity: 1\n14\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n15\t  adapter_pattern: 1\n16\t  existing_foundation: 1\n17\t  open_questions: -1\n18\t  external_dependency: 0\n19\t  human_process_gates: 0\n20\t  repo_access: 1\n21\t  architecture_claims: 1\n22\timplementation_type: null\n23\tinvestigation_signals: null\n24\tai_implementability: High\n25\tai_implementability_score: 5\n26\tjira_key: null\n27\tbranch: null\n28\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-8006-E002\n29\tgate_failure_impact:\n30\t  action: rewrite\n31\t  fallback_approach: If additional AuthBridge variants (authbridge-envoy, authbridge-lite)\n32\t    are included in the Tech Preview set, the CSV gains one SHA256-pinned RELATED_IMAGE_*\n33\t    entry per additional variant; if proxy-only is confirmed, scope stays at the kagenti-operator\n34\t    and authbridge-proxy entries.\n35\t---\n36\t# OLM/CSV packaging with RELATED_IMAGE entries for disconnected installation\n37\t\n38\t## Description\n39\t\n40\tAdd the kagenti-operator to the ClusterServiceVersion (CSV) with SHA256-pinned `RELATED_IMAGE_*` environment variable entries, enabling OLM relatedImages for disconnected/air-gapped installation with image mirroring, and declare the new component CRD and RBAC in the CSV. The set of AuthBridge variants receiving `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entries is fixed by the Tech Preview variant-set decision; this epic's entry list expands or contracts with that outcome.\n41\t\n42\t## Scope\n43\t\n44\t- Add `RELATED_IMAGE_KAGENTI_OPERATOR` (kagenti-operator image, SHA256-pinned) and `RELATED_IMAGE_AUTHBRIDGE_PROXY` (AuthBridge proxy sidecar image, SHA256-pinned) to the CSV\n45\t- Add `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entries for any additional AuthBridge variants included in the Tech Preview variant set\n46\t- Declare the `KagentiOperator` CRD in the CSV\n47\t- Include RBAC for the component controller to manage kagenti-operator resources\n48\t- Use the existing CSV packaging tooling in rhods-operator\n49\t\n50\t## Acceptance Criteria\n51\t\n52\t- The CSV declares the `KagentiOperator` CRD and the component controller RBAC\n53\t- The CSV contains `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entries for the kagenti-operator image and every AuthBridge variant in the Tech Preview scope, with SHA256-pinned digests available at packaging time (the digests are filled in from the Konflux-built images — a configuration reference, not a build dependency)\n54\t- Given a disconnected RHOAI installation using image mirroring with the component `Managed`, the operator and AuthBridge images resolve from the mirrored registry via the `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entries, measured by the kagenti-operator Deployment running with images from the mirror registry\n55\t\n56\t## HLR Traceability\n57\t\n58\t- P1 HLR: OLM/CSV packaging with `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entries for disconnected installation\n59\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b1933c3e4a75d57c","agent_id":"a39dea4f4915a7ea0","session_id":"5aaaeded-1f18-481f-917f-f792958e6a2c","uuid":"768f00ad-6853-4003-ac1e-e47ef61032a3","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:11:55.975Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-aed4f20516bf7474","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review revised decomposition"}
